d": "600769042344423", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75367595_600769045677756_4184331693265155160_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ca0110cI1sMQ7kNvwH6J8V1&_nc_oc=Adq1pvnAOLJrZ0paqbdZNLvKKe74VTcBOCtTcZHXD8UgXcDqCmnHGDzmZFBppilQjI0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPdvV4Mu__W4cvLv5kzrWhzLVDdF6ls_Sl1XTCKKqKH_Q&oe=6AE600AF"}, {"file_name": "com.NEKR_VR.EduVR (5).png", "id": "511803525221127", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031608_511803535221126_6449582359268280911_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OVoVaHfd7loQ7kNvwF15P_A&_nc_oc=Adq5U135UthT4akJvqz0NUW1664Pz1pF0jG2aJfRpNglXR2130pVRsdbTXe7aI8_FVk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNyOuf22eRtlXwT9TYd9bkUea-kUHxtu9jJv1sHIsWCiA&oe=6AE60518"}, {"file_name": "com.NEKR_VR.EduVR (6).png", "id": "1380952959552847", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003258_1380952966219513_7539545808247244132_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MKhqzqq6tfYQ7kNvwE1crfT&_nc_oc=Ado-RGu_xaClEW4DYBzNNhV3sRSXOgeszCKWSWEb6jpHCuW22PPkztH99ilJGRY5Gxw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMBtnPWIpGeGDN_CGoeamawM_kHhf0QZfRF0tl7sWNXzA&oe=6AE6127C"}, {"file_name": "com.NEKR_VR.EduVR (10).png", "id": "2014764132301448", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75451776_2014764135634781_3715488626808879103_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QFQhV6TTtCkQ7kNvwHttQtq&_nc_oc=AdqNmxmC2-2yG_eslqSuO8r1L1nwGgX1XjR2jq2YnpEVzhQZBfoip5hSIvOezDzq5UE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNANCz6OAULQB22EOM5a1hMi4cHjg1H-P5Ab2KVGiXJzg&oe=6AE5E4AB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "593570069731482", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974502_593570076398148_755855805457355311_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Kc3t7yz93uUQ7kNvwFsP-Eg&_nc_oc=AdrQz4cqRkcysNcQSI3PG58t5-I6c1y4zk_b2yy-tp3ZQU53c8cWbhVw1XnC7jVXCOM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOyoVyHA2iz8T4WRR6Ecr1AA9hwyhGyzWIYiO7s2Ze63A&oe=6AE60C10"}, "display_name": "EduVR", "keywords": ["education", "school", "workshop", "modern"], "long_description": "## Revolutionizing Education with Virtual Reality  \n\n**EduVR** is a modular educational VR application designed for schools, offering a new way to engage students in learning. Teachers and students become part of realistic simulations and practical tasks that promote active learning, safe experimentation, and a better understanding of complex topics.  \n\n---\n\n## **Key Features**  \n\n- **Modular System:** Covers a wide range of subjects and disciplines, with new modules regularly added.  \n- **Easy to Use:** No need for a powerful PC \u2013 EduVR runs directly on Meta Quest.  \n- **Safe Learning:** Simulate situations that can't be safely performed in traditional classrooms (e.g., safety training).  \n- **Interactive:** 5\u201310 minute tasks and simulations, ideal for integration into regular lessons.  \n- **Progress Tracking:** Teachers can monitor students\u2019 progress and provide personalized feedback.  \n\n---\n\n## **Benefits for Schools**  \n\n- **Engaging Lessons:** Virtual reality increases students\u2019 interest in learning and enhances their skills.  \n- **Cost Savings:** Vocational schools can simulate working with expensive materials and equipment.  \n- **Flexibility:** Adaptable to different subjects and age groups.  \n- **Practical Applications:** Prepares students for real-life scenarios in a safe and efficient way.  \n\n---\n\n## **Try it for Free**  \n\nDownload the free version of EduVR and access a new module every 14 days. Discover how EduVR can transform education at your school and get started today!  ", "short_description": "Transform your classroom with EduVR, the modular educational VR app 